                "_type": "Diesel Product Detail",
                "about": {
                    "image": {
                        "src": "https://cdn2.unrealengine.com/egs-aplaguetaleinnocence-asobostudio-s2-1200x1600-c28b6b91c9a6.jpg",
                        "_type": "Diesel Image"
                    },
                    "developerAttribution": "Asobo Studio",
                    "_type": "Diesel Product About",
                    "publisherAttribution": "Focus Entertainment",
                    "description": "Rock Paper Shotgun - “Cinematic delights every step of the way”\nIGN - “A Plague Tale’s story is immediately compelling”\nTelegraph - “Gripping, heartbreaking”\n\n\nFollow the grim tale of young Amicia and her little brother Hugo, in a heartrending journey through the darkest hours of history. Hunted by Inquisition soldiers and surrounded by unstoppable swarms of rats, Amicia and Hugo will come to know and trust each other. As they struggle to survive against overwhelming odds, they will fight to find purpose in this brutal, unforgiving world.",
